            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>Only use if no specific subclasses of core:Role describe the role.</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A person&apos;s, group&apos;s or organization&apos;s role in an endeavor</obo:IAO_0000115>
