        <obo:IAO_0000115>A role inhering in a person or organization that is realized when the bearer participates in providing a service to meet the need of another person or thing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An role of an individual within his or her profession or institution; use outreach provider role for community service or other activities outside the profession.</obo:IAO_0000115>
