        <obo:IAO_0000114 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A general term primarily used for digitally stored data such as computer programs and other kinds of information read and written by computers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>PERSON: Melissa Haendel</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computer_software</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:comment>IAO is a planned specification, in SWO is an Information artifact. In eagle-i, we have a need to collect material instances and is it thus currently classified as a material entity.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Software</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


