        <obo:IAO_0000115>A service offering that describes a service in which the consumer receives the right to use a resource (instrument, database, software, etc) that is owned or managed by a service provider.  Ownership of the accessed resource remains with the service provider during and after provision of service.</obo:IAO_0000115>
