        <obo:IAO_0000112>A personal communication manifested in some document.</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A personal communication manifested in some document.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A personal communication manifested in some document.</rdfs:comment>
